      "id": "comp-m4szahsl",
      "heading": "Hi, I'm Joel Polanco",
      "body": [
        "I'm a senior product manager who loves to solve hard problems, meet new people, and have some fun along the way. I'm a big fan of slash careers and pursuing one's passions through side bets.",
        "Currently, I'm writing about product management, advising a pre-seed [battery startup](https://www.ionic-devices.com/), and [coaching future founders](https://desertpacificicorps.org/) on customer discovery."
      ],
